WEBVTT

00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:05.506
Futurama is brought to you by
Thompson's Teeth

00:00:05.589 --> 00:00:08.675
The only teeth strong enough
to eat other teeth.

00:00:41.917 --> 00:00:43.252
Good news, everyone.

00:00:43.335 --> 00:00:48.298
Today marks our dear friend Dr. Zoidberg's
10th year with Planet Express.

00:00:48.382 --> 00:00:50.050
Huzzahs are in order!

00:00:50.676 --> 00:00:52.094
- Huzzah.
- Huzzah.

00:00:52.177 --> 00:00:55.347
Hooray for me! Hooray for Zoidberg!

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:57.516
I will now read the mandatory speech.

00:00:58.684 --> 00:00:59.935
"Dear employee,

00:01:00.018 --> 00:01:03.355
"has it really been five, 10 or 15 years?

00:01:03.438 --> 00:01:06.316
"If not, please disregard this
and get back to work."

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:09.236
Distribute token of appreciation
and applaud.

00:01:10.779 --> 00:01:12.948
Look! Coupons!

00:01:13.031 --> 00:01:15.868
I can get two oil changes
for the price of one!

00:01:15.951 --> 00:01:17.911
Now if I could only afford the one.

00:01:17.995 --> 00:01:20.789
And the car. Ah, the years.

00:01:20.873 --> 00:01:22.875
So many memories.

00:01:22.958 --> 00:01:26.670
So many strange fluids gushing
out of patients' bodies.

00:01:26.753 --> 00:01:28.964
Yes, yes. Now here's
your pension statement.

00:01:30.299 --> 00:01:33.468
It's empty because you haven't
paid into it, you dumb stinkbug!

00:01:33.552 --> 00:01:37.681
You kept track of it all these years.

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:39.057
Oh, no! I'm boned!

00:01:39.141 --> 00:01:42.519
I haven't paid into the pension, either.
What'll I do when I retire?

00:01:42.603 --> 00:01:43.854
I thought you were retired.

00:01:43.937 --> 00:01:46.231
Hey, I don't see you
planning for your old age.

00:01:46.315 --> 00:01:50.235
I got plans.
I'm gonna turn my on/off switch to off.

00:01:50.319 --> 00:01:53.947
Well, I'm gonna take action.
It's time to check on my retirement fund.

00:01:56.241 --> 00:01:58.452
Damn. Still only $100.

00:01:58.535 --> 00:02:00.704
A penny saved is a penny earned.

00:02:00.787 --> 00:02:03.665
Also, could you get some
athlete's foot cream for my face?

00:02:03.749 --> 00:02:06.793
He's right.
I've got to start investing wisely.

00:02:08.879 --> 00:02:10.547
Well, down to my last lottery ticket.

00:02:11.798 --> 00:02:13.509
Cherry.

00:02:13.842 --> 00:02:15.511
Cherry!

00:02:15.677 --> 00:02:18.055
Mule. Crud!

00:02:18.138 --> 00:02:20.933
So, you got six bucks left to retire on.

00:02:21.016 --> 00:02:22.935
I recommend Tender Vittles.

00:02:25.521 --> 00:02:28.357
You're opening
a retirement account for $6?

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:31.693
I'm sure a wealthy mule farmer
like yourself

00:02:31.777 --> 00:02:34.196
is aware that we charge a $10 monthly fee.

00:02:34.279 --> 00:02:35.864
You gotta spend money to make money.

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:38.158
Here you are, sir.

00:02:38.242 --> 00:02:40.661
Your account is now overdrawn by $4.

00:02:41.036 --> 00:02:44.623
Jeez. I've seen lines move faster
in the sperm bank.

00:02:44.706 --> 00:02:47.501
That's for... Roberto, is that you?

00:02:47.584 --> 00:02:49.294
Bender! Hey, man!

00:02:53.257 --> 00:02:55.425
You old lunatic! How ya been?

00:02:55.509 --> 00:02:57.886
Oh, not bad. Not bad.

00:02:57.970 --> 00:03:01.098
Everybody on the floor! This is a stickup!

00:03:03.267 --> 00:03:04.601
Yeah, I'm doin' okay, too.

00:03:04.685 --> 00:03:07.563
I'm takin' a Chinese cooking class
at the Learning Annex.

00:03:07.646 --> 00:03:09.565
Cool. Can you give me a hand here?

00:03:09.648 --> 00:03:11.149
Sure thing, pal.

00:03:11.733 --> 00:03:13.235
Hey, you! Red!

00:03:13.318 --> 00:03:15.404
Quit waterin' that plant and get the door!

00:03:17.531 --> 00:03:21.243
- Well, nice talkin' to ya.
- Same here. You guys are all right.

00:03:21.326 --> 00:03:23.036
Here's somethin' for your trouble.

00:03:23.120 --> 00:03:24.663
Hey, thanks, buddy!

00:03:29.585 --> 00:03:31.461
Freeze, punks! You're under arrest!

00:03:31.545 --> 00:03:34.673
Shoot 'em in the back!
Quick, while they're not looking!

00:03:39.636 --> 00:03:40.762
Court is in session.

00:03:40.846 --> 00:03:43.265
The Honorable Judge Whitey presiding.

00:03:43.891 --> 00:03:45.809
The charge is bank robbery.

00:03:45.893 --> 00:03:49.146
Now, my caddy's chauffeur informs me

00:03:49.229 --> 00:03:53.609
that a bank is a place where people
put money that isn't properly invested.

00:03:53.692 --> 00:03:58.906
Therefore, robbing a bank is tantamount
to that most heinous of crimes,

00:03:58.989 --> 00:04:00.991
theft of money.

00:04:01.074 --> 00:04:04.411
As the surveillance camera for that bank

00:04:04.494 --> 00:04:06.830
what all the judge was a-jawin' about,

00:04:06.914 --> 00:04:10.417
could y'all tell us what you done seen
the day of the crime?

00:04:10.501 --> 00:04:13.504
Well, let's see.
My memory's a little fuzzy,

00:04:13.587 --> 00:04:15.839
but it went exactly like this.

00:04:20.719 --> 00:04:23.722
Your Honor, I move that I be disbarred

00:04:23.805 --> 00:04:26.975
for introducin' this evidence
against my own clients.

00:04:28.869 --> 00:04:31.121
Mr. Fry, do you recognize

00:04:31.204 --> 00:04:34.583
the robot a-huggin' on you
in this here hologram?

00:04:34.666 --> 00:04:36.918
I sure do. That's the real robber.

00:04:37.002 --> 00:04:39.504
And I'll never forget
his name as long as I live.

00:04:39.588 --> 00:04:40.839
And that name is...

00:04:46.553 --> 00:04:50.974
Fry, just give a name!
You don't want to look stupid on Court TV!

00:04:51.058 --> 00:04:53.435
You're right. You're right. It was...

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:57.314
Yes? What?

00:04:57.397 --> 00:05:00.150
You say if I testify I'll be killed?

00:05:00.233 --> 00:05:02.110
Oh. It's for you.

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:07.282
And the other hamburger
will also be made of your lungs.

00:05:07.366 --> 00:05:09.201
So long, pal.

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:12.245
I refuse to testify on the grounds

00:05:12.329 --> 00:05:14.498
that my organs will be chopped up
into a patty.

00:05:15.082 --> 00:05:16.875
Ah! The 67th Amendment.

00:05:16.959 --> 00:05:20.003
I may be a simple country hyper-chicken,

00:05:20.087 --> 00:05:22.130
but I know when we're finger-licked.

00:05:22.214 --> 00:05:24.174
What do you say we plead insanity?

00:05:24.257 --> 00:05:28.095
A few months in an insane asylum?
I could do that standin' on my head.

00:05:28.178 --> 00:05:31.014
If you start now, it might help our case.

00:05:31.098 --> 00:05:35.894
Counselor, what evidence do you offer
to support this new plea of insanity?

00:05:35.978 --> 00:05:39.439
Well, for one,
they done hired me to represent them.

00:05:39.523 --> 00:05:41.775
Insanity plea is accepted.

00:05:41.858 --> 00:05:42.859
Mr. Bender,

00:05:42.943 --> 00:05:47.197
I hereby commit you to the asylum
for criminally insane robots

00:05:47.281 --> 00:05:50.075
until such time as you are deemed cured.

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:51.243
Yahoo!

00:05:51.326 --> 00:05:53.453
The system fails again!

00:05:53.537 --> 00:05:54.871
And Mr. Fry,

00:05:54.955 --> 00:05:58.959
I sentence you to the home
for criminally insane humans.

00:05:59.042 --> 00:06:01.253
Your Honor, that facility has been full

00:06:01.336 --> 00:06:03.755
ever since you ruled
that being poor is a mental illness.

00:06:04.631 --> 00:06:05.799
Order! Order!

00:06:05.882 --> 00:06:07.718
The only poor people I want to hear about

00:06:07.801 --> 00:06:10.554
are the people who tend
to my pores at the spa.

00:06:10.637 --> 00:06:13.849
Just send them both
to the robot loony bin and let's go.

00:06:25.193 --> 00:06:29.031
Ow! My head! Ow! My feet!
Ow! My head! Ow! My feet!

00:06:29.114 --> 00:06:31.116
- Keep your chin up.
- Ow! My chin!

00:06:41.001 --> 00:06:44.755
I don't belong here, Bender.
This is an asylum for insane robots.

00:06:44.838 --> 00:06:47.174
Well, you meet half the qualifications.

00:06:50.344 --> 00:06:51.762
Oh, good! A physical!

00:06:51.845 --> 00:06:54.765
Once they examine
my fragile, naked, pink body,

00:06:54.848 --> 00:06:56.099
they'll see I'm not a...

00:07:04.775 --> 00:07:06.276
Whee!

00:07:07.694 --> 00:07:10.197
Ooh! Ah!

00:07:28.298 --> 00:07:30.300
What the...

00:07:30.384 --> 00:07:32.177
I find that offensive!

00:07:39.142 --> 00:07:42.187
Greetings. I am Dr. Perceptron.

00:07:42.271 --> 00:07:44.856
Let me give you something
to help you relax.

00:07:47.442 --> 00:07:49.486
Look, there's been a terrible mistake.

00:07:49.569 --> 00:07:52.322
I'm a human being. See?
I'm all squishy and flabby.

00:07:52.520 --> 00:07:53.871
Also, I complain a lot.

00:07:53.896 --> 00:07:56.994
Yes, you do. You need to relax more.

00:07:57.077 --> 00:07:58.495
Terrific.

00:07:58.578 --> 00:08:00.247
Now consider the following.

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:02.582
You were admitted to this robot asylum.

00:08:02.666 --> 00:08:04.793
Therefore, you must be a robot.

00:08:04.876 --> 00:08:06.461
Diagnosis complete.

00:08:07.337 --> 00:08:10.465
I do other human stuff! I age. See?

00:08:13.135 --> 00:08:14.511
I'm Nurse Ratchet.

00:08:14.594 --> 00:08:16.680
Please come with me, won't you?

00:08:23.937 --> 00:08:26.773
We'll meet your roommate next, shall we?

00:08:26.857 --> 00:08:28.775
His name is Malfunctioning Eddie.

00:08:28.859 --> 00:08:30.402
The car dealer?

00:08:30.485 --> 00:08:32.654
Wow. I guess his prices
really were insane.

00:08:32.738 --> 00:08:36.658
He's very excitable.
So don't say anything to surprise him.

00:08:39.661 --> 00:08:42.080
- Pleased to meet you.
- Actually, we've met once before.

00:08:42.164 --> 00:08:43.248
What?

00:08:52.466 --> 00:08:55.552
I'm a pretty girl. I'm a pretty girl.

00:08:55.636 --> 00:08:57.554
I'm a pretty girl.

00:08:58.096 --> 00:09:00.015
Whoa! Someone had a busy day.

00:09:00.098 --> 00:09:01.683
My roommate exploded.

00:09:01.767 --> 00:09:04.728
You gotta help me, Bender.
How can I prove I'm human?

00:09:04.811 --> 00:09:06.730
You could drop dead. That'd show 'em.

00:09:06.813 --> 00:09:08.231
I don't wanna!

00:09:08.315 --> 00:09:10.484
Hey, man. I believe you're a human.

00:09:10.567 --> 00:09:11.860
- You do?
- Sure.

00:09:11.944 --> 00:09:13.612
They don't believe I'm a human, either.

00:09:13.695 --> 00:09:17.532
Name's Unit 2013.
Come on. Let me introduce you around.

00:09:17.616 --> 00:09:20.494
Fry, meet Norm. How's it goin', pal?

00:09:20.577 --> 00:09:23.580
Still pickin' up transmissions
from the CIA on your teeth?

00:09:23.664 --> 00:09:26.583
They just won't stop!

00:09:26.667 --> 00:09:32.297
The CIA Cafeteria menu
for the week of May 15 is as follows.

00:09:32.381 --> 00:09:34.424
Monday, shepherd's pie.

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:36.843
Cuckoo.

00:09:37.386 --> 00:09:39.763
Let me guess. He thinks he's Lincoln?

00:09:39.846 --> 00:09:41.890
Well, he's supposed to. The problem is,

00:09:41.974 --> 00:09:45.060
he's got multiple personalities,
all of 'em Lincoln.

00:09:46.853 --> 00:09:50.190
I was born in 200 log cabins.

00:09:50.691 --> 00:09:52.317
And this here is Frankie.

00:09:52.401 --> 00:09:54.319
He's convinced he's a lunchroom worker.

00:09:54.403 --> 00:09:56.238
So they put him to work in the lunchroom.

00:09:56.471 --> 00:09:59.141
How is workin' the lunchroom, Frankie?

00:09:59.224 --> 00:10:01.476
- It's all right.
- Poor Frankie.

00:10:08.458 --> 00:10:10.043
Change places!

00:10:12.546 --> 00:10:15.757
Bender, I can't take much more of this.
I want outta here!

00:10:15.841 --> 00:10:18.093
Are you crazy? This place is great.

00:10:18.176 --> 00:10:21.722
Electroshock whenever you want it.
Two Lincolns for every Napoleon.

00:10:21.847 --> 00:10:23.849
Ah!

00:10:23.932 --> 00:10:25.726
Sweet light crude.

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:31.690
But I'm not a robot like you!
I don't like having discs crammed into me.

00:10:31.773 --> 00:10:34.192
Unless they're Oreos.
And then only in the mouth.

00:10:34.276 --> 00:10:36.278
Don't you understand? I'm gonna die here.

00:10:36.987 --> 00:10:39.448
Ah, quit your bellyachin'
and take it like a robot.

00:10:41.283 --> 00:10:43.118
Change places!

00:10:48.999 --> 00:10:52.878
The doctor says you are making
great strides with your exploding problem.

00:10:52.961 --> 00:10:54.254
Well, the way I see it...

00:10:57.090 --> 00:10:59.551
You gotta get me outta here.
I would have starved to death

00:10:59.635 --> 00:11:01.762
if not for that sick
vending machine robot.

00:11:03.847 --> 00:11:05.349
Give me! Give me!

00:11:07.476 --> 00:11:10.854
Poor Fry.
He's got the munchies for freedom.

00:11:10.938 --> 00:11:13.982
We're all trying to help you.
We've petitioned the governor.

00:11:14.066 --> 00:11:17.819
But he doesn't want to appear soft
on people who've been falsely imprisoned.

00:11:17.903 --> 00:11:21.365
At least I have friends on the outside.
Bender's been no help at all.

00:11:21.448 --> 00:11:23.408
Je suis Napoleon!

00:11:25.285 --> 00:11:26.995
Now, seriously, I'm not.

00:11:27.079 --> 00:11:30.290
Bender, you should be more
ashamed of yourself than usual.

00:11:30.374 --> 00:11:31.792
Lighten up, honey.

00:11:31.875 --> 00:11:34.836
I'm just tryin' to get through
a difficult time using humor.

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:39.299
Visiting hours are over.
Time for our medication discs.

00:11:39.925 --> 00:11:42.386
Help me! For God's sake, help me!

00:11:42.469 --> 00:11:44.179
Oh, don't worry, Fry.

00:11:44.262 --> 00:11:48.517
I, too, once spent a nightmarish time
in a robot asylum.

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:51.186
But now, it's nearly over. So long.

00:11:56.233 --> 00:11:58.235
Thirty days hath September, April, June.

00:11:58.318 --> 00:12:00.404
All the rest have peanut butter.
Now what?

00:12:02.322 --> 00:12:05.075
Oh, God! What? What? What is it now?

00:12:06.118 --> 00:12:07.327
You are being released.

00:12:07.411 --> 00:12:10.330
Finally! Sweet justice!

00:12:10.414 --> 00:12:12.582
Sweet, juicy justice!

00:12:12.666 --> 00:12:14.668
Not you. Him.

00:12:14.751 --> 00:12:16.920
Me? What a surprise!

00:12:20.048 --> 00:12:22.592
Look! I barely exploded at all.

00:12:22.676 --> 00:12:25.262
We can control that with medication.

00:12:25.345 --> 00:12:28.974
Fry? Are we ready
to meet our new roommate?

00:12:33.645 --> 00:12:35.439
Hi, Red!

00:12:35.522 --> 00:12:38.150
Roberto? What are you doing here?

00:12:38.233 --> 00:12:40.485
I got busted robbin' that bank again.

00:12:40.569 --> 00:12:42.613
Why would you hold up the same bank twice?

00:12:42.696 --> 00:12:46.575
That first time was just
to case the joint and rob it a little.

00:12:46.658 --> 00:12:48.827
What's the matter? You scared?

00:12:51.038 --> 00:12:52.623
Noticeably? I'll say.

00:12:52.706 --> 00:12:55.417
Now, stand back.
I gotta practice my stabbin'.

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:58.128
No! Please! Help!

00:12:58.253 --> 00:13:00.088
Stop it! Police!

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:04.676
Hey, keep it down in there!
I'm tunin' my banjo!

00:13:06.219 --> 00:13:08.430
Geez, Red. Quit cowerin'.

00:13:08.513 --> 00:13:10.891
You call yourself a robot?

00:13:13.477 --> 00:13:16.605
I'm not a robot! I'm not a robot!

00:13:21.568 --> 00:13:23.737
In answer to your question, Hermes,

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:25.739
yes, your friend is cured.

00:13:28.408 --> 00:13:31.995
You'll notice he no longer
suffers delusions of humanity.

00:13:32.079 --> 00:13:34.998
Affirmative. I feel nothing. I am a robot.

00:13:35.248 --> 00:13:37.918
Beep, beep, beep, beep, beep...

00:13:38.001 --> 00:13:42.297
You've made a terrible mistake.
He's a human being, not a machine!

00:13:42.381 --> 00:13:43.757
Oh, Fry!

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:46.426
Beep, beep, beep, beep, beep...

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:50.472
Gonna sing a little tale
About a battle called Waterloo

00:13:50.555 --> 00:13:52.516
Bonjour, y'all!

00:13:57.104 --> 00:13:58.230
Listen to me, Fry.

00:13:58.313 --> 00:14:01.525
Just because you think you're a robot
doesn't make you a robot.

00:14:01.608 --> 00:14:05.529
After all, I think I'm a doctor,
but that doesn't make me a doctor.

00:14:05.654 --> 00:14:07.030
These fancy clothes do.

00:14:07.114 --> 00:14:08.949
Negative. I must be a robot.

00:14:09.032 --> 00:14:12.202
Why else would human women
refuse to date me?

00:14:12.286 --> 00:14:13.620
Oh. Lots of reasons.

00:14:13.704 --> 00:14:15.831
Bio-units, terminate noise exchange.

00:14:15.914 --> 00:14:18.667
It is time for you to ingest
sandwiches from my compartment.

00:14:25.841 --> 00:14:28.677
Here we go. Just a minute.

00:14:29.594 --> 00:14:32.764
And down the stretch,
it's Daddy's Little Grandpa,

00:14:32.848 --> 00:14:37.311
followed by Perennial Loser
and bringing up the rear, it's Lasty!

00:14:37.394 --> 00:14:40.272
- Come on, Lasty!
- Hey, Bender.

00:14:40.439 --> 00:14:44.192
Roberto! Ooh! What a surprise
to see you in here!

00:14:44.276 --> 00:14:46.737
Especially 'cause
I didn't squeal on ya, remember?

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:50.032
Remember all that squealin' I didn't do?
Remember? Do ya?

00:14:50.115 --> 00:14:52.242
Yeah. Yeah. Now lie down and play dead.

00:14:52.326 --> 00:14:55.454
- And don't ham it up.
- Sure. Anything for you, buddy.

00:14:59.666 --> 00:15:02.794
Wait here, Bender.
I need to get a disguise.

00:15:13.222 --> 00:15:14.473
Uh, what's with the getup?

00:15:14.556 --> 00:15:16.934
I'm in disguise
'cause I'm thinkin' of escapin'.

00:15:17.017 --> 00:15:19.770
You in? Or do I gotta kill ya
so ya don't squeal?

00:15:19.853 --> 00:15:21.188
I'm in! I'm in!

00:15:22.180 --> 00:15:23.815
So, when were you plannin' the breakout?

00:15:24.205 --> 00:15:27.319
I'm thinkin' maybe a few seconds ago.

00:15:28.779 --> 00:15:30.864
Quick! Let's keep escaping!

00:15:57.557 --> 00:16:00.560
Times two, carry the one.

00:16:02.312 --> 00:16:04.690
You sad, worthless human.

00:16:06.650 --> 00:16:09.987
Sacred hog of Prague!
That was my anniversary gift to Labarbara.

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:12.447
Fear not, for I shall assist ye.

00:16:12.531 --> 00:16:14.533
Robots don't say "ye."

00:16:14.616 --> 00:16:15.701
Relax, mammal.

00:16:15.784 --> 00:16:18.912
My robotic software
shall meet your calculatory needs.

00:16:19.538 --> 00:16:21.373
What is the meaning of this symbol?

00:16:21.456 --> 00:16:23.875
That's a plus sign, you pointy-head loony!

00:16:23.959 --> 00:16:25.836
Quit thinkin' you're a robot!

00:16:25.919 --> 00:16:28.005
I'll show ye.

00:16:36.596 --> 00:16:38.473
Stand back! I'm a toolbot.

00:16:46.523 --> 00:16:49.401
You're not a toolbot.
You're not a food-motron.

00:16:49.484 --> 00:16:51.320
You're not a robot of any kind.

00:16:51.403 --> 00:16:52.654
Yes, I am.

00:16:52.738 --> 00:16:55.907
I simply haven't discovered
my primary function yet.

00:16:56.992 --> 00:16:58.910
Okay. This has got to stop.

00:16:58.994 --> 00:17:03.749
I'm going to remind Fry of his humanity
the way only a woman can.

00:17:03.832 --> 00:17:06.376
You're going to do his laundry?

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:09.671
Fry, this is for you.

00:17:20.474 --> 00:17:22.643
- Beep.
- Oh, for God's sake!

00:17:26.647 --> 00:17:30.067
By a scallop's forelocks.
What's with all the beer, Fry?

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:32.736
Alcohol fuels my power cells.

00:17:32.819 --> 00:17:35.322
And as a mighty robot, I...

00:17:35.405 --> 00:17:37.407
Beep.

00:17:40.744 --> 00:17:42.621
Thanks for helpin' me escape, Bender.

00:17:42.704 --> 00:17:43.914
It was nothin'.

00:17:43.997 --> 00:17:46.833
It was not nothin'! I want to repay you.

00:17:46.917 --> 00:17:48.752
Let me get you somethin' in here.

00:17:51.213 --> 00:17:53.715
Hands up! This is a stickup again!

00:17:53.799 --> 00:17:56.218
Wow. Hitting the same place three times?

00:17:56.301 --> 00:17:58.387
I admire your style, Roberto.

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:00.931
Give me the remainin' dough
and all the calendars.

00:18:01.014 --> 00:18:02.182
And that pen!

00:18:02.265 --> 00:18:04.768
Try to tear it so most of the beads
are on my end.

00:18:05.644 --> 00:18:06.853
Police! You're busted!

00:18:06.937 --> 00:18:09.648
And don't try anything.
This glass here is laser-proof.

00:18:11.817 --> 00:18:12.985
Fire lasers!

00:18:13.527 --> 00:18:14.861
Duck, lasers!

00:18:16.655 --> 00:18:19.992
Come on! I got a place
where I like to hide after crimes.

00:18:26.081 --> 00:18:29.209
Aw! He looks like a little
insane drunken angel.

00:18:31.837 --> 00:18:35.090
Hey, everybody. Meet my good pal, Roberto.

00:18:35.173 --> 00:18:37.551
- Hey, mon.
- Nice to meet you...

00:18:37.634 --> 00:18:40.387
- Come out with your hands up!
- Hostages!

00:18:45.369 --> 00:18:47.622
Back off! I got hostages!

00:18:47.686 --> 00:18:49.396
Hooray! I'm helping.

00:18:49.479 --> 00:18:51.898
Do you have any better hostages?

00:18:51.982 --> 00:18:55.193
To show them who's crazy,
I'll execute some of you.

00:18:55.277 --> 00:18:57.112
- How about you?
- Ouch!

00:18:57.195 --> 00:18:59.740
That's going to bleed when my heart beats.

00:18:59.823 --> 00:19:01.700
Wait! Take me first!

00:19:01.783 --> 00:19:03.327
Yes! Take her first!

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:04.578
Shut up!

00:19:04.661 --> 00:19:06.330
Stop tellin' me how to do this!

00:19:10.083 --> 00:19:11.376
The fear.

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:13.503
I'm thinkin' of a number
between one and 10.

00:19:13.587 --> 00:19:16.423
Guess it, and you die first. Go!

00:19:16.632 --> 00:19:18.175
Um... Okay.

00:19:18.508 --> 00:19:21.261
Fifty-six-ish?

00:19:21.345 --> 00:19:23.680
Fifty-six? Fifty-six?

00:19:23.764 --> 00:19:26.391
Oh, man! Now that's all I can think about!

00:19:26.475 --> 00:19:29.561
I'm gonna kill you, you no-good 56-ing...

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:36.234
Don't kill me yet!

00:19:36.318 --> 00:19:39.655
I'm startin' to come down
with Stockholm Syndrome, handsome.

00:19:41.657 --> 00:19:43.116
Halt, fellow robot!

00:19:44.368 --> 00:19:45.535
Hey, Red!

00:19:45.619 --> 00:19:49.206
You're just in time
to join the hostage situation.

00:19:49.289 --> 00:19:51.208
Which side do you want to be on?

00:19:51.291 --> 00:19:54.711
The side that kicks
your twisted metal ass.

00:19:54.795 --> 00:19:57.547
Fry! Stay back! He's too powerful!

00:19:57.631 --> 00:19:59.299
Negative, bossy meat creature.

00:19:59.383 --> 00:20:01.718
I know now what my primary function is.

00:20:01.802 --> 00:20:03.011
I am a battle-droid,

00:20:03.095 --> 00:20:05.639
sworn to protect the weak
from crazy robots.

00:20:05.722 --> 00:20:07.975
I'm not crazy! Don't call me crazy!

00:20:08.058 --> 00:20:09.643
I'm just not user-friendly.

00:20:09.726 --> 00:20:11.311
Fry, don't be a hero!

00:20:11.395 --> 00:20:13.230
It's not covered by the health plan!

00:20:13.313 --> 00:20:16.650
Let's see how much
of a robot you really are...

00:20:25.158 --> 00:20:28.370
No knife can penetrate
my skin-tanium armor.

00:20:31.999 --> 00:20:35.168
Help! Help! He is a battle-droid!

00:20:35.252 --> 00:20:37.004
Somebody help me!

00:20:37.838 --> 00:20:39.256
Mommy!

00:20:39.339 --> 00:20:42.175
I'm sorry I spilled
the transmission fluid, Mommy.

00:20:42.259 --> 00:20:45.387
No, no! Don't weld me to the wall, Mommy!

00:20:58.150 --> 00:21:00.527
We're willing to listen to your demands.

00:21:01.903 --> 00:21:05.449
Hey, baby.
Wash that off before you put it back.

00:21:05.532 --> 00:21:07.451
- Hooray!
- Bravo!

00:21:07.534 --> 00:21:08.744
You did it, Fry.

00:21:08.827 --> 00:21:10.412
Congratulations, buddy.

00:21:10.495 --> 00:21:12.372
You're a credit to my race.

00:21:12.456 --> 00:21:14.833
It was nothing. I... Ah!

00:21:16.877 --> 00:21:19.838
Blood? Robots don't have blood.

00:21:19.921 --> 00:21:22.549
- I must be a...
- A squid?

00:21:22.633 --> 00:21:25.260
A human! Oh, my God!

00:21:25.344 --> 00:21:27.554
- I'm a human!
- Also good.

00:21:30.724 --> 00:21:32.726
Thanks for saving us, Fry.

00:21:33.936 --> 00:21:37.147
I'm gonna continue
never washing this cheek again.

00:21:37.230 --> 00:21:40.192
Buddy, you may be wrapped in greasy skin,

00:21:40.275 --> 00:21:43.445
but inside,
you've got the heart of a robot.

00:21:43.528 --> 00:21:44.988
Aw! Thanks, Bender.

00:21:45.072 --> 00:21:48.700
Just like inside me,
I've got the heart of a human.

00:21:50.702 --> 00:21:52.037
What?

00:21:53.538 --> 00:21:54.748
What?